        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Based on past experience, users with `nohidden` are going to wonder why some features (like remembering cursor position) don't work. We could go further and recommend that they do:\n\n    autocmd FileType directory setlocal bufhidden=hide\n\nbut that's also mitigated since Nvim defaults to 'hidden' (unlike Vim).",
